      "content": "That makes sense. I've noticed that sometimes when playing in certain registers, there seem to be these slight, almost unidentifiable frequencies that don't quite fit the standard harmonic series perfectly. How does the presence of those \"unwanted\" or non-harmonic partials affect the overall perception of the sound?",
